<title>USA: Group lifts Advanced Therapeutic stake.</title>
<headline>Group lifts Advanced Therapeutic stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including HBK Investments LP said it raised its stake in Advanced Therapeutic Systems Ltd to 9.6 percent or 375,600 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 69,500 additional shares of the company on September 11 at prices ranging from $35.50 to $35.63 a share.</p>
